= Rust {0.603475967, 0.644007155}", "   [the same check: Rust ", "P2-7a CJT", 
   ", Python ", "YP2-7b CJT", "]"],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.0043307507446012`*^9},
 CellLabel->
