energies like a mass: the BdG matrix with N = (M - m) beta (x) 1_2 and P = \
Phi_a (K^3)^dag has the eigenvalues -+(q^2 + M^2 + Phi_a^2)^(1/2), eight \
times each (20 random q, M, Phi_a)\"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"   [the same check: Rust \"\>", 
