BdG matrix with N = (M - m) beta (x) 1_2 and P = Phi_a (K^3)^dag has the \
eigenvalues -+(q^2 + M^2 + Phi_a^2)^(1/2), eight times each (20 random q, M, \
Phi_a)", "   [the same check: Rust ", "P3-8", ", Python ", "YP3-8", "]"],
