Cell[TextData[{
 "The generators that leave a condensate unchanged span its stabilizer; the \
code finds them as the null space of the real linear conditions ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
       StyleBox["A", "TI"],
       LimitsPositioning->True], "\[ThinSpace]", 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["c", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["A", "TI"]], 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["A", "TI"]]}], ")"}], 
    StyleBox["w", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "0"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "248d72f0-0aaf-4804-9640-2bb83492270c"],
 " on the coefficients ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["A", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "99efb21e-6e9b-4bdd-afda-f73f2637be32"],
 ", for each pair field ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["w", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "74ffcfdd-ec46-4934-ac9f-b20291f7faa2"],
 " of the condensate with its generators ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["A", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3d48f94d-27a6-481a-a5d4-945279125c63"],
 ". In ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["SU", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}], 
     StyleBox["L", "TI"]], "\[Times]", 
    StyleBox["U", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", "1", ")"}], 
     StyleBox["Y", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5dd15ba9-d0dc-4edc-a20a-f70c48d11092"],
 " the stabilizer of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPhi]", 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"0", ",", "\[Phi]"}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e393cc45-49b9-45f8-ab40-ff1edd660d73"],
 ", and of the neutral vacuum of the hypotheses with both pair fields, is \
spanned by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Q", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SM",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e0d4fa70-b473-48d6-9aa0-b13001d9ef91"],
 ": the breaking ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["SU", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}], 
     StyleBox["L", "TI"]], "\[Times]", 
    StyleBox["U", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", "1", ")"}], 
     StyleBox["Y", "TI"]], "\[RightArrow]", 
    StyleBox["U", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", "1", ")"}], 
     StyleBox["Q", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c8750dd4-0557-4e82-8871-8a3498a6c1d9"],
 " of the Standard Model. Among the eight generators ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["a", "TI"], ",", 
      StyleBox["SM",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]}]], ",", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["a", "TI"], ",", 
      StyleBox["R",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]}]], ",", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["R", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], ",", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["F", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["tot",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "abf6b05f-b6a7-444f-8883-7fdf9cacfa34"],
 " the stabilizer of the bidoublet ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Phi]", "\[ThinSpace]", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    SuperscriptBox["\[Tau]", "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "fb8ef271-272b-4b7f-b91a-d722811f940b"],
 " (equal lengths of the two pair fields) is spanned by the three generators ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["a", "TI"], ",", 
      StyleBox["SM",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]}]], "+", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["a", "TI"], ",", 
      StyleBox["R",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f91c8ab9-f1a2-40a8-ad6f-45119ce1828c"],
 " of the custodial group ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["SU", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}], 
     StyleBox["V",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "fb7cfc64-0a8d-4182-a3c9-0caf0ab9aa1f"],
 " and by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["R", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "69cf0fd2-70f7-4529-b78b-f653a1534177"],
 "; three gauged generators and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["F", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["tot",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3569d5e4-3739-4e4e-a6b6-5c83b24af8c5"],
 " are broken. A neutral vacuum of equal lengths with other phases keeps four \
generators (a conjugate of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["SU", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}], 
     StyleBox["V",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "113845b7-fdb2-405a-ba0a-eb5307a0bac9"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["R", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "179554f3-5ea2-486c-a41b-d29f06868ca7"],
 "), and one of unequal lengths keeps only ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"3", ",", 
      StyleBox["SM",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]}]], "+", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{"3", ",", 
      StyleBox["R",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "24bec882-275d-4d9f-aaa4-d2d17e090b30"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["R", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "47e69f75-a735-40a1-b216-01a1eb966512"],
 ". ",
 StyleBox["WQN-11f.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " A generic second condensate in any channel with a charged component, added \
to the neutral vacuum, leaves no generator of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["SU", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}], 
     StyleBox["L", "TI"]], "\[Times]", 
    StyleBox["U", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", "1", ")"}], 
     StyleBox["Y", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8cc2d540-3597-4001-a333-5007df3cd576"],
 " unbroken, while one in the neutral part of a channel keeps exactly ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Q", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SM",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d0fcce02-377b-4960-8dc6-5adfc6efdbdf"],
 ": the mean fields of the methods must keep the second kind only."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"bfc7d694-d7b0-47cf-b605-8cda8564e8a7"],

