   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"rvCheck", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<WQN-11\>\"", ",", 
      " ", "\"\<the stabilizer of (0, phi) and of the neutral vacuum of H5 in \
SU(2)_L x U(1)_Y is spanned by Q; that of \\\ni tau^2 among the eight \
