Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
R.1.13 Remark R8: the electroweak gauge bosons cannot form the condensate\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"df12ed2b-3e46-453a-a11f-0697cca1845a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The remark.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " It was first made as \"the electroweak gauge bosons cannot bind the pairs; \
the attraction is the pairing term of the hypotheses\", about the first \
version. That was not correct as stated, and it was corrected during the work \
on the second version: the gauge bosons cannot form the condensate. ",
 StyleBox["Why \"cannot bind\" was false.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " At tree level the exchange of one massless vector boson of a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["U", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "1", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a279ee09-1e91-4fa4-82e9-6d9e419cada8"],
 " with the coupling ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["X", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "efbbe8a0-6981-478e-b443-e14b6f0c87fd"],
 " between two particles of the charges ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], "1"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f6d9789d-d62e-4053-afe0-120f88ac6b50"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], "2"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "321b86f8-e91a-439f-b5ea-ea1723bfc904"],
 " gives the static potential ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["X", "TI"], "2"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["c", "TI"], "1"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["c", "TI"], "2"], "/", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"4", "\[Pi]", 
      StyleBox["r", "TI"]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c633e7f4-c30c-478a-918c-baf6dbeee81a"],
 "; opposite charges attract, and an attraction proportional to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1", "/", 
    StyleBox["r", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a8aea600-50cb-42eb-b35f-94b44a3741aa"],
 " binds two particles however weak it is, as in the hydrogen atom. The next \
cell computes the products of the charges of a particle of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPsi]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "87b411c3-1fd9-468b-ab3a-0216df07d5e5"],
 " and a particle of a singlet from the generators of Section R.1.1. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Mu]", 
    StyleBox["a", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "65939353-4792-499b-a9da-5679d7f0c4c0"],
 " does not act on the singlets. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["B", "TI"], "\[Mu]"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0099fcad-627f-4b19-bf48-471d3b201851"],
 " couples to the hypercharges: it repels ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[CapitalPsi]", "\[Chi]"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e6c99a8c-95df-4e34-93cc-3de6a1739fbf"],
 " (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"+", 
    FractionBox["1", "16"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "792fd144-61d6-4d16-9ac4-c597beb42db5"],
 ") and, in the second version, attracts ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[CapitalPsi]", 
    SuperscriptBox["\[Chi]", "\[Prime]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7198df33-360d-4cbd-b10c-7a9f5c3df07e"],
 " (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"-", 
    FractionBox["3", "16"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "628cf779-444e-415d-9ad6-60f6feb2ede0"],
 ") already in the symmetric vacuum. After the breaking the photon attracts a \
down particle to a particle of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[Chi]", 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2db11d6d-e2bc-41b0-9cc5-008b98b94d25"],
 " (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"-", 
    FractionBox["1", "16"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "303668ba-a44f-4f50-aa9a-3684f15ce659"],
 ") and an up particle to a particle of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Chi]", 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[Prime]"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "bb4e35b7-c8c7-4f0f-bf1f-40bacaf3fc19"],
 " (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"-", 
    FractionBox["9", "16"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d9ed3dda-c8d0-4efd-8e27-966978bbe233"],
 "), and repels the other two combinations (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"+", 
    FractionBox["3", "16"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4da6fda7-51f5-43ba-ab4e-32bb88c6e127"],
 "). ",
 StyleBox["Why they cannot form the condensate.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " In the vacuum, which has no Fermi surface, a condensate forms only above a \
critical strength of the attraction: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], ">", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["crit",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "53752047-e71e-430d-9dc0-ede78efbf693"],
 " for the pairing term (Section R.2), and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["e", "TI"], "2"], "/", "4", "\[Pi]", ">", "\[Pi]", "/", "3"}], 
   TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ec2969dc-11e4-4f1e-98fa-3430eca78057"],
 " for a massless vector boson in the ladder approximation of the \
Schwinger-Dyson equation (T. Maskawa and H. Nakajima, Progress of Theoretical \
Physics 52, 1326 (1974)). The strongest attraction, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["9", "16"], 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["e", "TI"], "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "22a77a1b-d51b-4122-9cd5-5e870bccc74f"],
 ", corresponds to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["9", "16"], "\[CenterDot]", 
    FractionBox["1", "137"], "\[TildeTilde]", "0.004"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8b066d48-8b24-40c1-b4e5-e4afdf351c20"],
 ", more than two hundred times below ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Pi]", "/", "3"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6c1d84d4-c221-4628-b4dd-bcd1fa74b399"],
 ". ",
 StyleBox["Why it matters.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The superfluid rests on the assumed pairing interaction, whose origin the \
hypotheses do not explain, as in the models in which the Higgs doublet is a \
bound state of the top quark held by a four-fermion interaction (W. A. \
Bardeen, C. T. Hill and M. Lindner, Physical Review D 41, 1647 (1990)); no \
known force can replace it. The fine-structure constant ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1", "/", "137.036"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ae23d4bf-ca2a-4887-aa48-4e2f164dc67f"],
 " is the rounded value of the Particle Data Group; no program of the folder \
computes the numbers of this remark except the charges."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"97d7913d-311c-4f77-8e19-471b0948461c"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"--", 
     RowBox[{"--", " ", "remark"}]}], " ", 
    RowBox[{"R8", ":", " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "the", " ", "products", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "charges", " ", "of",
       " ", "a", " ", "particle", " ", "of", " ", "Psi_LL", " ", "and", " ", 
      "a", " ", "particle", " ", "of", " ", "a", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"singlet", " ", "--"}], "--"}]}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
     "in", " ", "the", " ", "numbering", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", 
      "matrices", " ", "from", " ", "1"}], ":", " ", 
     RowBox[{"the", " ", "components", " ", "1", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", "up", ")"}], " ", "and", " ", "2", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", "down", ")"}], " ", "of", " ", "Psi_LL", " ", "with", " ", 
      "the", " ", "Dirac", " ", "index", " ", "0"}]}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"9", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"(", "chi_SH", ")"}], " ", "and", " ", "13", " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"chi", "'"}], "_SH"}], ")"}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"r8Comp", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"<|", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\"\<up\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "1"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<down\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "2"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<chi\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "9"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<chi'\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "13"}]}], "|>"}]}], ";"}], 
   "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
    "the", " ", "products", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "hypercharges", " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"the", " ", "exchange", " ", "of", " ", "B"}], ")"}], " ", 
     "and", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "electric", " ", "charges", " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"the", " ", "exchange", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "photon"}], 
      ")"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"r8Rows", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
           "p", " ", "<>", " ", "\"\< with \>\"", " ", "<>", " ", "s"}], ",", 
           " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"YY", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"r8Comp", "[", "p", "]"}], ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"r8Comp", "[", "p", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
            RowBox[{"YY", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"r8Comp", "[", "s", "]"}], ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"r8Comp", "[", "s", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n",
            "     ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"QQ", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"r8Comp", "[", "p", "]"}], ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"r8Comp", "[", "p", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
            RowBox[{"QQ", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"r8Comp", "[", "s", "]"}], ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"r8Comp", "[", "s", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",",
          " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"p", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<up\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<down\>\""}], "}"}]}], "}"}], 
         ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"s", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
