Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
R.3 The masses of the gauge bosons and the modes of the superfluid (stage 4)\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"dd4d7b55-af02-43ee-925f-a152f84ad6dc"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Stage 4 computed, for the five methods and both versions, the effective \
potential ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["eff",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     SubscriptBox["\[CurlyPhi]", 
      StyleBox["SH",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b36099bc-61cf-4cb3-a775-67cabafff3ba"],
 " of the pair fields along the direction of the vacuum and its minimum at \
the pair amplitude ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[CurlyPhi]", 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "66356a3b-0402-4b4d-822d-ff90231f30f3"],
 "; the susceptibilities ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Chi]", 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["ab", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f7b938a8-7ecb-46a4-8b28-d412b15d5905"],
 " of the charge densities of the eight generators to their chemical \
potentials ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Mu]", 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["b", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6c022e40-dcd7-4747-9983-3edc7940fefa"],
 "; from them the scale ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["v", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "2", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", 
      SubsuperscriptBox["\[Chi]", 
       StyleBox["SH",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], "11"], ")"}], 
     RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f88a4807-e373-4d22-845e-f3881a31d1f2"],
 ", defined by the mass ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["W", "TI"], ",", 
      StyleBox["SH",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]}]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["g", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["v", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "/", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "560b7243-e593-4e00-ac58-cf2ec20b0c2d"],
 " of the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["W", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b47e3d12-64a6-4430-852f-704109af4134"],
 " boson, the mass ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["Z", "TI"], ",", 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4a65d3f7-1e7a-4f6e-8067-34b8ad97ad38"],
 " and the ratio ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[Rho]", 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Chi]", 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "11"], "/", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Chi]", 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "33"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "852f4338-765f-471c-bbbe-0fe1cbd2f05a"],
 "; and the frequency of the amplitude mode, the candidate for the Higgs \
boson, once from the effective Lagrangian of the pair fields (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["EFT",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6af94e41-5253-42c9-bfd0-82e171cc21f4"],
 ") and once from the linear response of the time-dependent mean field at a \
frequency (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["H",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c5bead39-a8f1-435e-b32e-d99553ec95d7"],
 "). ",
 StyleBox["Why the chemical potentials.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " A uniform time component of a gauge field acts on the fields as a chemical \
potential of its charge. The normal vacuum has a gap and keeps every charge, \
so it does not respond to a small chemical potential, and the masses of the \
gauge bosons come from the condensate alone; the space components would carry \
the artifact of remark R10 (Section R.2.6). For a Lorentz-invariant vacuum \
the time and the space components of a gauge field have the same mass. The \
checks of this section derive the formulas of the Rust program symbolically \
and evaluate the closed forms of the pairing-only methods. The section starts \
from a clean slate."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"548124fd-1fd0-424f-8cca-e48be2967ed5"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"--", 
     RowBox[{"--", " ", "Section"}]}], " ", "R", ".3", " ", "starts", " ", 
    "from", " ", "a", " ", "clean", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"slate", " ", "--"}], "--"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"rvClean", "[", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
    "the", " ", "names", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "three", " ", "tables", " ",
      "of", " ", "the", " ", "Rust", " ", "program", " ", "sh_higgs", " ", 
     "that", " ", "this", " ", "section", " ", "reads", " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"rows", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "data", " ", "cell"}], 
      ")"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"minFile", ",", " ", "massFile", ",", " ", "valFile"}], "}"}], 
     " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
